#. type: Plain text
#: docs/features/pair-programming-v1.md:6
msgid "# Pair Programming v1 — Workbench Design"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/features/pair-programming-v1.md:9
msgid ""
"> **Phase 1 ✅ Implemented** (2026-05-29): three-column UI, highlight.js "
"viewer, studio tree/file/search, xterm terminal, `studio-pair-programming` "
"platform.  > API shape is **tRPC** (`connectors/webui/src/trpc/routers/"
"studio.ts`), not REST examples below."
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/features/pair-programming-v1.md:19
msgid ""
"**Ship fast, not feature-complete:** Minimal viable scope to close the loop "
"of \"review code with Agent in Studio\""
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/features/pair-programming-v1.md:19
msgid ""
"**Lightweight start:** File tree + file viewer + global search + chat + "
"terminal; no Monaco Editor yet"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/features/pair-programming-v1.md:19
msgid ""
"**Syntax highlighting via highlight.js** (not Monaco Editor) to reduce first "
"implementation cost"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/features/pair-programming-v1.md:19
msgid ""
"**Read-only first:** v1 focuses on reading code; Agent analyzes and "
"suggests, no direct edit/save yet"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/features/pair-programming-v1.md:19
msgid ""
"**Platform identity separation:** Pair programming sessions use dedicated "
"platform id, isolated from parlor chat sessions"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/features/pair-programming-v1.md:19
msgid ""
"**Local direct read:** Files read server-side (not Probe); workspace path "
"configured in chamber settings"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/features/pair-programming-v1.md:19
msgid ""
"**Terminal in Phase 1** (promoted from original Phase 2)—important for "
"debugging and ops"
msgstr ""

